alse,"text":"和華の同級生でクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりエキセントリックな少女で、普通の概念が一般人のそれとは異なっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「異端研究会」という世の中で起きる不思議な出来事（魔法やオカルト）や集団に属さないアウトローを研究、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"観察する同好会を自主的に無許可で運営しており、月に一度の会報などはそれ相応の読み物としてなかなかの評価を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はバカというかネジの一本抜けたような感じで、他の追従を許さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのためほとんど友人はいないが唯一彼女を受け入れてくれる和華には、絶対の信頼を寄せている。なぜか軍人口調。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「おはようっす、今日もいい天気っすね～。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"およ？和華っち。なんか元気ないっすねぇ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/6765582f74fded2ce5584db3cba83e408a711e52463bfc0dcdb7cf4d5a2cb432.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3e764a72d205cc53182abbdb3f24da7d9354e8ae305450ef909215125bd9766.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:197185:47988:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c19143","characterName":"ニア＝シュリヒテ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47985","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"197185"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25334"],"vndbCharacterId":"c19143"},"originalCharacterName":"ニア＝シュリヒテ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of pair of dark elves who accompany Sofie as her caretakers (or possibly babysitters), Urr and Nia are from a special race that possess cat tails and ears."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because Sofie is so unreliable, they constantly remain by her side to offer support."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Their race has a history of being the target of discrimination, so they have a simultaneous respect and antipathy for the Demon Lord."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Urr wears priestess outfits and maid outfits while Nia wears traditional Japanese clothing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The sisters are total opposites, with Urr being calm and strong-willed and Nia being extremely immature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c19143"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソフィの従者兼遊び相手のダークエルフ。ウルは彼女の双子の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天真爛漫で能天気な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"知能指数が低いわけではないが、あまり難しい言葉を覚えられず、片言になることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とりあえず、勇者である主人公にすぐに懐いた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25334","sourceWorkId":"7986","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソフィの従者でありお目付け役のダークエルフ。ウルの双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天真爛漫な性格で周りをあかるくさせる。けして知能指数が低いわけではないのだがなぜか片言。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソフィと妹のことを常に大切に想っており、それらを傷つけるものは血の報復をもって購わせることも辞さない。とりあえず、勇者にはすぐなついた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ニアは腹いっぱい食べられたらそれでいい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/234d104845784ea233cb99356d4342312e4cfc3047eb6283cb09b8a82a2b9525.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7eceec9a720f07c05079fea88d606291294332716da0030728b5b8f64c52f56a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:197185:47985:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c19144","characterName":"ウル＝シュリヒテ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"character